<title>UK: SBAB sets A$110 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>SBAB sets A$110 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Toyo Trust International and Kokusai (Europe).</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBAB</p>
<p> AMT    AA$110 MLN    COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    20.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    20.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
